  "priorExpiration": "2009-07-27",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 521.01 Definitions. The terms enumerated in this part shall have the meaning set forth herein, unless a different meaning is clearly stated in the text, as follows:\n\n(a) “Designee” means state official or employee and does not include an agent, or employee of an agent, that has contracted with the department of transportation;\n\n(b) “Electronic toll collection system” means “electronic toll collection system” as defined in RSA 236:31, I(c);\n\n(c) “Electronic toll collection monitoring system” means “toll collection monitoring system” as defined in RSA 236:31, I(d);\n\n(d) “Nonrenewal” means refusal to issue or renew a motor vehicle registration, in accordance with RSA 261;\n\n(e) “Owner” means owner as defined in RSA 259:72;\n\n(f) “Pay” means “pay” as defined in RSA 236:31, I(g); and\n\n(g) “Violation” means “violation” as defined in RSA 236:31, I(h).\n\nSource. #8544, eff 1-20-06; ss by #9372, INTERIM, eff 1-26-09, EXPIRES: 7-27-09; ss by #9487, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12426, eff 11-30-17 (formerly Saf-C 217.01) (See Revision Note at part heading for Saf-C 522); ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 522.01)",
